url":"https://api.github.com/users/arpit-saxena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arpit-saxena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arpit-saxena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-08-04T08:54:30Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T04:07:41Z","closed_at":"2025-08-07T04:07:41Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-17791](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-17791)\n\n\n[DB-17791]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-17791?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ\n\nThis is a bug in connection manager’s authentication passthrough mechanism.\n\nWhen we connect consecutively to a cluster with authentication enabled (e.g. using password auth), we get the error FATAL:  authentication identifier set more than once.\n\nTo reproduce this, create a cluster with these flags:\n\n```\n--enable_ysql_conn_mgr=true\n--ysql_conn_mgr_use_auth_backend=false\n--ysql_conn_mgr_superuser_sticky=false\n--ysql_enable_auth=true\n```\n\nThen run this command:\n\n```\nPGPASSWORD=yugabyte ./bin/ysqlsh -U yugabyte -d yugabyte -p 5433 -c 'SELECT 1;' && PGPASSWORD=yugabyte ./bin/ysqlsh -U yugabyte -d yugabyte -p 5433 -c 'SELECT 1;'\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"yugabyte-ci","id":17281578,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjgxNTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17281578?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte-ci","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/28149/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/28149/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}